<#-- Ported from the original FreeMarker template; HTML interpolation is escaped.
     has(x): FreeMarker's ?has_content, an empty text, list or map is false -->
<#assign has = (v) => v != null && v !== '' && (typeof v === 'object' ? (typeof v.length === 'number' ? v.length > 0 : typeof v.toNumber === 'function' || Object.keys(v).length > 0) : true)>
<#assign dateFormat = dateFormat ?? "dd MMM yyyy">

The following invoices are now past due and we have not received payment for the unpaid amounts listed below.

Please contact us immediately to discuss payment options.

Past Due Invoices

<#list invoiceList as invoice>
Your Order: ${invoice.otherPartyOrderId ?? ""}
Ref #: ${invoice.referenceNumber ?? ""}
Invoice: ${invoice.invoiceId}
Date: ${ec.l10n.format(invoice.invoiceDate ?? null, dateFormat)}
Due: ${ec.l10n.format(invoice.dueDate ?? null, dateFormat)}
Total: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(invoice.invoiceTotal ?? 0, invoice.currencyUomId ?? "USD")}
Unpaid: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(invoice.unpaidTotal ?? 0, invoice.currencyUomId ?? "USD")}

</#list>

<#if (paymentList?.length> 0)>
Payments not yet Applied

<#list paymentList as payment>
Payment Ref #: ${payment.paymentRefNum ?? ""}
Payment #: ${payment.paymentId}
Date: ${ec.l10n.format(payment.effectiveDate ?? null, dateFormat)}
Total: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(payment.amount ?? 0, payment.amountUomId ?? "USD")}
Unapplied: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(payment.unappliedTotal ?? 0, payment.amountUomId ?? "USD")}

</#list>
</#if>

<#if (creditInvoiceList?.length> 0)>
Credit Memos not yet Applied

<#list creditInvoiceList as invoice>
Your Order: ${invoice.otherPartyOrderId ?? ""}
Credit Ref #: ${invoice.referenceNumber ?? ""}
Memo #: ${invoice.invoiceId}
Date: ${ec.l10n.format(invoice.invoiceDate ?? null, dateFormat)}
Due: ${ec.l10n.format(invoice.dueDate ?? null, dateFormat)}
Total: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(invoice.invoiceTotal ?? 0, invoice.currencyUomId ?? "USD")}
Unapplied: ${ec.l10n.formatCurrency(invoice.unpaidTotal ?? 0, invoice.currencyUomId ?? "USD")}

</#list>
</#if>

Total Past Due: ${ec.l10n.format(toDecimal(unpaidInvoiceTotal ?? 0).subtract(unappliedPaymentTotal ?? 0).subtract(creditInvoiceTotal ?? 0), "#,##0.00")}

Customer #: ${toParty.pseudoId}
